<title>CANADA: UGG details Canada barley supply and dispositions.</title>
<headline>UGG details Canada barley supply and dispositions.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Grain Growers Ltd on Wednesday issued its supply and disposition estimates for Canadian barley in the 1996/97 (Aug/July) crop year.</p>
<p>SUPPLY     96/97 Est.  95/96 Est.  5-yr-avg ('000 tonnes)</p>
<p>opn stcks  1,806	 1,820	 2,745</p>
<p>output    15,910	13,035	12,069</p>
<p>total:    17,716	14,857	14,819</p>
<p>USE</p>
<p>exports    3,000	 2,332	 3,044</p>
<p>seed	   400	   460	   397</p>
<p>human food 1,000	   904	   791</p>
<p>feed/waste 9,300	 9,355	 8,009</p>
<p>total:    13,700	13,051	12,241</p>
<p>CARRYOVER  4,020	 1,806	 2,577</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
